{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1500,
  "batch_count": 1701,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "624b11ee6bac4894f9e1bac15c5037fc7d787286",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cdab01d72a9a5fe211e35ef6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要撒上我的自备芝士粉，午饭\r\n就能换个不错的口味呢～。您要是愿意，\r\n训练员也来试试？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1295497b8c09292117c1b7c5632f10adfd8da57df9b53343a181e97a4aa8d36",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e53f6470fccfb4a466072622",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "您好，训练员！\r\n呵呵，打招呼是拉近\r\n心灵距离的魔法呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "66c559ca8c17f604bdfaaa609a33656b4de9a7d2250d46e798bd7dd6797ed520",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:421a5a561ce9c183f37d920f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "已经晚上了啊～。先追一下电视剧的\n最新一集――等等，啊！\n我还约好了，要帮朋友写作业！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d31e16307a054a58f0e08cc28a7b87817b66a9f97e1bbbd9bf490654ab43879b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c83fbe163dbc22cdfe8710c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "宿舍偶尔会办怪谈大会哦。\r\n说可怕也确实可怕……可还是\r\n忍不住好奇听到最后…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f37b8fe703b0841bda7f6a149ace268d1cdc2260f87a2710a28b81fe18396ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9abe7eb90ff3e741d0e52e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在车站前收到的纸巾，\r\n我还有很多。花粉让您\r\n难受的时候请告诉我！",
      "source_fingerprint": "76460e8c82e6e7a0d02dcf470238697ccfd9a1e604c3e034db244f344c9c9fb7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00cbf86dd1fa78603646dd7a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好热啊～，大家都还好吗～…\r\n担心过头每年都会把冷冻瓶装水\r\n买得太多…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b128b6fdc0ded4f32173d54e0c99c75f28069d10496713668a9de4ab06eff52",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:083094dfa3ef4964941179f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是运动的秋天呢。我要专心\r\n做点什么好呢～…果然还是\r\n训练……等等，这不跟平时一样吗",
      "source_fingerprint": "837fb5a1543e5308bb017096da61329c3785aef0d2bf6a0b59604b2c8223335d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:068f1990fbb903c6bd9e227a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一旦积雪，到处铲雪都\r\n很辛苦。得把我的雪铲\r\n拿出来备用…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "61c091b11033e225a63f03a70781fde562833f43295fb90a4c60be2073b2f74c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7d5fb577881836b72ab6301",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶嘿嘿……情人节，快乐？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b2d0e25d0f1ae9a0d87e4c7b131ee354286ad9885e37f2602c60a110ab03c10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c5adb418bfceed833348209",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "其实我当上了小茶座专属的牛奶挑选\n师。约好了一起做出\n最棒的欧蕾咖啡！",
      "source_fingerprint": "29aae42816ee0fe14499f6accef3fe3045d1eb1e0966b1ee10bf5d7747b1733a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a5856dda1911b118ca1d9ca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个，接下来是洗衣服。晚饭\r\n……啊，原本轮到小速子。\r\n听说她忙着研究，所以我来代劳",
      "source_fingerprint": "be92a2330b95a540175462d6808ef39c528aaf73bba7f691d820ea461818c7a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc6d79d2b86422591c437968",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小宝穴邀请我去参加自由式・\n比赛。听说最重要的是毅力\n所以……我会加油的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "397ea04d8a7b7a515c615f74edb665868ce09656ee5273ce87880630d7219631",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1724f1439ebcfee13ef6009d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "铺上高级芝士！牛奶也\r\n很讲究！这种感觉的限定\r\n菜单我总会忍不住点呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c7b830e91191807736a4d363d11efac5be3f5c700d13aedcdbb0e6e61a74f1a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7bc5d6e995b087dc1af6f5a0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "偶尔会有人说『快驹太天真了！』。\n是吗…？\n不过我确实不擅长吃辣…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e63d9f253c7deeef0d66e2c3ad8a879335bfa4a023021dab97784a7f241ffbb3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e50bcde4814e11f10fcedaf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯～很方便活动！光是穿着这个和大家\r\n一起跳舞就很开心。\r\n……可以的话，我还是想站在中间。",
      "source_fingerprint": "66a524ae84171f1f5e2dc66bd99dfcc871a003445f7247ab2d37ac5a53b4a3c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8dbcd1b43ed81d9438530368",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "闪亮的服装……如果能穿着它\r\n在舞台上成为主角……\r\n简直就像迎来了大结局。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed231804a9a7512c2967d4cdd1d0e3c779c8571aee5468a04f3f94a43f7275ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d8716671d3386cfa7b69002",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我居然能有穿上这个的一天\r\n……诶嘿嘿。不管穿几次\r\n都会变得像在做梦一样呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6e6aa845b6e73470576600ac1b5fd6787d36ea50ca563f28fcae99b4d4e7606",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f1e4f4357cb2f2332afa203",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看起来很气派吗？呵呵，我好像\r\n也比平时更有自信了些……\r\n这就是所谓先从外形入手吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e897632bf204360fcfe3ae1f4cf25d3ed03192d35a7d55e2ee2fd265349f932",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe87496945945f320eaa632a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "像是早安英里和早安努，\n大家连问候都很有个性呢……\n早安哟♪……不，还是普通点吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "039b48656e8b3c6b6e28f34b3f4331549591e0cfce5822499f9c2f0f22e77ec6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f5bfe80300d73fb08959ad3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "便当日也很开心哦！\r\n和朋友交换好多小菜\r\n遇见未知的美味……♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d64174feb8c3a08b63708e3c25d330a1ab6ec1ceeb8c8eefd62d0494602e3be9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20ed3b419ed8eb401fb64e39",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有自己的热奶锅，热牛奶\r\n一下子就能做好哦。\r\n睡前来一杯，怎么样？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e47583646ce4c5e9f9c2359fd167d7324cfe9d49335a83fb0fa5a8647317815",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38ebae3a48b8e3286440d821",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每年这个时候『有困难什么都可以问我』\r\n都会变成我的口头禅…。\r\n毕竟是新生很多的季节。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4451f042c6a9733c452ce9accfcc1ea846938a7c54d2596a42b3563c80a560c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30ec4cd3c0e577be4c12b4c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以前我习惯用垫板给朋友扇风\r\n但她们却说，这样让她们过意不去……\r\n那我改用手持风扇好了",
      "source_fingerprint": "ada8db753c82ce57026905319df32299077d4ad1def2bc0f11667244a5a4935c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4dc72e8e38036bcaf46fac4d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋天来了呢～。那个，\r\n秋刀鱼、蘑菇、栗子、柿子――\r\n唔～嗯，想法好老套…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b741458c6d79f078f2524d56ba8d1752e2ed3491c91ebfadc9dece2872dbcf5b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7e5d2f53dbfcd506be3f939",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "当雪仗裁判，给雪人\r\n取名字……呵呵，\r\n玩得开心就连寒冷都忘了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "692eecb5db0778f62d39ff04f7583573a2afb2391ccd201e52af7c24f6ce3216",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9bb2874e9c018307e9b66eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也努力吧！……毕竟主角\n都在看不见的地方努力，\n对吧。呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6f0fc392904b6146ed6be83dca11aa0a4765e5217c0eac605249e48ec5dfe10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3ce46d7ebb31ac053288ac1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要付出比其他赛马娘多一倍……不，是百倍的努力！\r\n我要练就一双……能一跃站到\r\n舞台中央的腿…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "161d0689a919a886825d1dc24fe0196c8f45c1e183b7b30af6540174ae39c1d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:410f33bef918392f00b7616f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有人会一起思考努力的方向\r\n……那件事，真的让人很有底气\r\n也很幸福。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a35c64c5f845085515282a96fdfcd4d8a44f621fa08f498ce7266b91c5fb2077",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f889fd18afe06fa78faaf5c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我真的能赢吗……\r\n要消除这种不安，\r\n到头来……也只有努力了吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cd562cfa70d77da7f1d083111af274333e53faee17de9b01e023daac6db0cea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0c4eed3e1dcb195fd904c94",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不被别的孩子做的事吸引目光……\r\n我就是我，\r\n我自己才是主角。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf65a6842aadb7ae203a764e6730da912a64748c15f49917c8811618d8c38c5f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbd35a7da83d5fb5ba0ab7c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这里全是厉害的孩子……\r\n但如果有训练员在，我也许\r\n也能成为“厉害的孩子”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ed4e9a49772ebd341affb36d19858233cf72244a7a3518ee488177a2c431426",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6d5f4720cadf165f020aaa6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……勇气。跑完只属于自己的路的\r\n勇气。抓住主角位置的\r\n勇气……请给我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4dfbfa74175b59219fdeeecdaa6c2adf709f27e4e57526842ab0288fb8cf126e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b82c6d3863f0715d6d4ece28",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说到海边虽然会想到波子汽水，但我\r\n更喜欢奶油苏打。努力\r\n训练之后再美美地喝上一杯～",
      "source_fingerprint": "43025abebb6b6add0b05afe5025d299a05fbd05187a5624484fd9c5961eb6ea5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:685231f0f7cf551f994130eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我和训练员……\r\n是两个人一起当主角的故事呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1f3bbc51ab200fb51f6fdc3dcaf94c2a69023a8b66f56bfd3bff68f2bc87a54",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25ac47d2146e1364680f33a0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "多亏有您，我才能跑完这段美妙的故事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "95d0417c33469bb0ef81d1c3f60a0f88c79a3d5c08f8efb45d06ea6cba13dfd0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93c4b3efcb7201875be112df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要是发出的饮料多到足以完成这些目标，\r\n庆典也会热闹起来吧……好，继续加油！",
      "source_fingerprint": "74e3311098a0cd6f718c1e4b64c6d5b91b7a6e00f0dcaf189bde7e1c97fa84db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "940000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74e78d26bec2d885ea8afc96",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼……这么多饮料发下去客人们应该没问题了……\r\n啊，得提醒自己别忘了之后领取奖励！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6dca376d98fedfb3326404786af9b0b0a85ffce5dc8853d253a572f6d001efb7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "940001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af9039e31c823fe443d3b20e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这次成长，是牛奶的功劳吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "642b1fed1604e7c119d8f729a2a9024a180b97ca254cc432dd9f479e5ced080c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:522046d7e965f3840a5cd918",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "已经不是配角了！…大概！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bba3440368bf8d384cea2253bd7123a12645b6c994586f73f28a7359d3a768e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8349e1dbc4633a8bfa1baca7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是烈焰快驹！请多指教！",
      "source_fingerprint": "56390d342a5b9a0df5438dd2d1bf386b884b03e14023064bdc0a2b7446e264b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9797e2274ee0a32e52799f9f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我也要成为闪耀的主角……\r\n我已经下定决心，非做到不可！",
      "source_fingerprint": "37fc86521f6af611b84181ea65056178b161a46b063622b97e4a2b46b86b1233",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af1a9bf253aee0f8b40f027e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要是我能做到的事！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4e5156c351a8ac107f9f9b58030ac48a26a38b6ae521f99143adbdadb031b79",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea131685828add85de6d2ade",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，这个我也来帮忙！",
      "source_fingerprint": "254b87cb4d5cb5775e489f1145ead8875e2354853fa99a64dd33976ad9d60bc0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0b1187ef0cb0539654a85d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "全力で、いきます！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0edfce041c74dd68a9b45fd554801f6bf60a50343da20a560e7de361e5c1989a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ce8a6142abae42822c0b0f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おれ、走ります。いちばんの形で\r\n『ありがとう』を伝えるために。\r\nもらった全部を、返すために…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "78996a1e8d0171bfc6964ff74c6c9c1b532d44819a239fe700ef8e02010a4fc9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c46f13006ab8ea14b3fcd3ec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってきます。",
      "source_fingerprint": "793275eb5254d9ee0aa95daa33c90a973bec2e4a987e75c094e5b5d339927bef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78bcf6e677597d4657884761",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "戻りました。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7cc6951a920e8084573735e4a0908d6d6b34e24b6a55a0aeb4ac698d3b94d9e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3c965136cc4d5020d95e4df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おれを見つけてくれて、\r\nみんなに恩返しする機会もくれて…\r\n本当に、本当に…優しい人ですね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "73c08a5089fd84edc06c08ba3ffd276cff0e825b4b7cac2539df18bc7f8957d9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1f7cb34fb537795a18130c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夜の浜辺、気持ちよかったな。\r\n…あれ、本当に\r\nわがままのつもりだったんですよ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "48e4e412928d1547abf4874368c8ac4e793221305acd124b35474dca95b84d61",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2a13a20b01124c9aaabd501",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "毎年この時期は、病院のピアノで\r\nお正月ソングを弾くんです。\r\nささやかでも…楽しんでほしくて。",
      "source_fingerprint": "966013ab45f41a15b936cf774729ecda3748718ad83d3e7fc746549fe2cc8baf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:278086c453bc5cbbc7c757e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "チョコをたくさん作ってるうち、\r\nこんなにあげたい人がいるんだって\r\n嬉しくなって…幸せ者です、おれ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "842a5728d549c8e0ff33d7c6f2924893fd06c115641a7678ee64a30663eb0c9b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97cd0ddbda6dd6d0a602f6a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "チョコ…もう少し持ってきてもいい\r\nですか？さっき渡したぶんだけじゃ\r\n伝えたい想いに足りない気がして。",
      "source_fingerprint": "18161a5b9b5f70d631e9386d471184b474fb7b92943c836a697b9fc68d070f94",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ac0dd6be1e9a36aef9555fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "七夕の願い事かあ…天の川に\r\n消えない橋、かけてみたいです。\r\n織姫と彦星が、毎日会えるように。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd82a072a8388c051714a4a52212599481881b2359455774c225304781f111ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6f6ef17e2fbae8585a70926",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年はどんなのにしよう…ふふ、\r\n病院のハロウィンパーティーで配る\r\nお菓子、選ぶのが毎年楽しくて。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a42df573132924526269f7a46040b51f12396a5103315f5b93dba4f4d4685d0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6923f6394c7318b2aa21bdc9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "めりくり～…！…ど、どうですか？\r\nヘリオスみたいに場を盛り上げ\r\nられたらって思ったんです、けど。",
      "source_fingerprint": "27c28a0176e57e223e74ebf9ee48b33b9a25455550c9c9fcd5c67873e36f7c2c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b076a882fd92016473d784cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冬でも、クリスマスはあんまり\r\n寒くない気がします。みんなや…\r\nあなたが、笑ってるからかな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d96e2953308ce79c59fde6203f211f240cb9c4a76d75d7ffd5e77ef6724c08bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2ea08d70aad391a8ebeee74",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "よし！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e270ec23d5b6ff96972f8f7ce419fa9a68cfadaff85b8bd73e39c0e874c4c578",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce2da859dcd47217e62978e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "うちのおせち、おれの好物だらけ\r\nで…おれの笑顔が、両親のご馳走\r\nなんですって。…いいのかなぁ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d19040c8852b14647e7007f297a90e121f676cf892acd25b5212809e442f38b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:673627e7a42240c9fa6a92af",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お誕生日、おめでとうございます。\r\nお祝いの方法、ずっと考えてたので\r\nここ数日、すごく楽しかったです！",
      "source_fingerprint": "02fdaf73b9c4a93c6d8e4e6de7224bd9eb8b24aeee4ad8b577b74eff3a84ae7a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9aed745dfe890ccfe685037c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "プレゼント、喜んでもらえるかな…\r\nでも、たくさん考えたし…ヘリオス\r\nたちにも相談したし…って、あ！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab57914affa04f9160ec9f260e29387fd68442fda46cf1659f33485bdbfe3daa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69b271717db1b51b3fa5fd72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今日はヘリオスたちがサプライズで\r\nパーティーをしてくれるらしくて…\r\nあれ？おれ、知ってていいのかな？",
      "source_fingerprint": "54931fcebd331af95d5a43ed6ca0a345132577631588a44db5a9c32651f690a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4f34ea5b0d1d34e20b09e37",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ありがとうございます！…ふふ、\r\nおかげさまで、一言じゃ全然\r\n足りないくらい、素敵な1年でした",
      "source_fingerprint": "0efa1445a65d5359dc7e1fb838ae28efbb00433f9c715df9176caf069f04d15b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf97b8d1b8ded4b31e48838b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お知らせがあるみたいです。\r\nよかったらおれ、\r\n見ておきましょうか？",
      "source_fingerprint": "92dbbe8599ab1c3396924b0f21960132233eaf8e7197ec06e7bbcfefbc5f0df5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:842de6de30554ee6e67a4df4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "わぁ、プレゼントが届いてますよ！\r\nふふっ、開けるのが楽しみですね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac36c79bbe90d5b59de40728e277235eb7ab535eba6747026c64296d6bdab64e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37371ff2289ab79bbb6ddd25",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ミッションクリアです。\r\nトレーナーさん、\r\nたくさん頑張りましたもんね…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7df5e654913841e63d885d319d472cd51f072e20bc692617c93b2ccd69577886",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9fa32b3689d91b4cae215580",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "もうすぐ、イベントが始まる\r\nみたいです。こういう催し、\r\n準備もわくわくしちゃいますね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbcd395a1258d26f4e302be1a8e1aef72cd436e88e0ac4e9a4eef8d99070b340",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d38fabec56cfd399437a46e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "イベント、始まってますね！\r\nみんな楽しそうで、\r\nおれまで嬉しくなっちゃうな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f593c980d1ce9f62e05efbdab21381a10e50020283c67d43d6ac6d6110d1721",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f544ba5bc9b7c9a88bfd33b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やるなぁ…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcf9e663fb908943bdf76e4d451399bcc2c3f05ed8cf3fdd876d2a43638f597e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b39ffc9691c8f42f7e0108a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あ、名鑑レベルが\r\n上がったみたいです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7ae252958316e9a40f9aa9fc7f352eeb9d43106303f535aa5745bde4903409a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7154441393be78a292df63a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "互角…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4431f90c64253fff04f5af91c67e03712d8dcc00ca02c5245572ef01259d4fcd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b70611411e58b519682cacde",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "みんなの勝利、ですね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "07cebd63c58a4ebb89c0f2eb14ee59a215c371537c482f52905bf2c398024a20",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45c029796f2d69ea2ef0eb4f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やるなぁ…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcf9e663fb908943bdf76e4d451399bcc2c3f05ed8cf3fdd876d2a43638f597e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3bb2932205fb7d0ecd9caf64",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "互角…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4431f90c64253fff04f5af91c67e03712d8dcc00ca02c5245572ef01259d4fcd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1e29173889d0bc28b7e449d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "スコア、更新です…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e9fc3e1b8f9076af603aa06f8c93abcabe70823dbdbeeb933f5cfeeb30aa0b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5c31e80c96e971f1438c316",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "うん…みんな、行こう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "78df9570d08420c31c154d2d85189a60480667cba1ce695d610d9a843328d7ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1762af895c885bd1b555c08f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43eedbd5672774f8a482dae9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーニングですか？\r\nなら、先に行って\r\n準備、しておきます！",
      "source_fingerprint": "58b457de77712d979f4f9308407a7ae8e6bf279710351c7dbd1c7be262f2be87",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de67507b49e580a1b2f6b897",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "人の数だけ、\r\n“奇跡”があるんですよね…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7df0f61eb86e61d06b4ce45f9b39d6782c70b0086d67b87a65f59946db63f949",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5628920eae6ea8901ee86fbf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "はい、レースですね。\r\nこれまでの成果、\r\nしっかり出し切ります！",
      "source_fingerprint": "887eeecc281cbcd88d2e97415a6d17d10c56b644be5b572e3a12e7e469d06410",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7522012756bf63b84c7b8ce8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "“奇跡”を…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "228172222763c93b74da865198c81b27922146e752059ebca4ddb638dc5e49e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1093",
        "1152"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
